ent-ClothingBackpackDuffelSyndicateFilledSyndicateCyborgAssault = Syndicate Assault Cyborg bundle
    .desc = Radio in a syndicate assault cyborg, equipped with a modified L6, a double esword and basic hacking tools. Comes bundled with a few Syndicate IDs for you and your buddies, just to make sure you're on the Cyborg's good side.
ent-ClothingBackpackDuffelSyndicateFilledSyndicateCyborgMedical = Syndicate Medical Cyborg bundle
    .desc = A medical borg, with syndicate variants of items where applicable. Comes with basic weapons. Comes bundled with a few Syndicate IDs for you and your buddies, just to make sure you're on the Cyborg's good side.
ent-ClothingBackpackDuffelSyndicateFilledSyndicateCyborgSaboteur = Syndicate Saboteur Cyborg bundle
    .desc = A saboteur cyborg, complete with syndicate advanced tools, standard hacking equipment and basic weapons. Comes bundled with a few Syndicate IDs for you and your buddies, just to make sure you're on the Cyborg's good side.
ent-ClothingBackpackDuffelSyndicateFilledSyndicateCyborgStealth = Syndicate Stealth Cyborg bundle
    .desc = A stealth cyborg. Whilst it is incapable of fighting, it has the ability to disguise, go invisible and move through vents. Comes bundled with a few Syndicate IDs for you and your buddies, just to make sure you're on the Cyborg's good side.
ent-ReinforcementRadioSyndicateMothroach = syndicate mobroach reinforcement radio
